## Why This Is Asked
Tests ability to design a scalable, tenant-isolated data lifecycle with cost control, secure archival, and reliable rollback.

## Key Concepts
- Per-tenant TTL and automatic archival
- CMEK-managed Cloud Storage archives
- Per-tenant datasets and IAM boundaries
- 24-hour rollback and restore testing
- Data contracts and end-to-end testing

## Code Example
```javascript
function computeRetainDays(tenantConfig) {
  // tenantConfig: { ttlDays: number, lastAccess: string }
  const now = Date.now();
  const expiry = new Date(tenantConfig.lastAccess);
  expiry.setDate(expiry.getDate() + tenantConfig.ttlDays);
  return Math.max(0, Math.ceil((expiry.getTime() - now) / (1000 * 60 * 60 * 24)));
}
```

